    {
      "id": "9c9930c7-578f-4529-9465-a4392e97ac79",
      "text": "The README records that checklist group 3, Step 2 was blocked after independent review and repairs. Local SQLite capture was documented as retaining originals and correction history, with stable links, reversible Trash, and explicit JSON backup/restore; exact-Unicode preservation and storage-open retry bugs were closed. Local checks passed for 21 storage functions, 17 app unit functions, 13 functional UI scenarios, Release builds/analysis, cleanup, and dark Release captures, but physical iPhone protection/performance, iOS 18 runtime validation, and unresolved accessibility checks still block passage. | When: November 14, 2026 | Involving: Eros MemoryOS project | This is the documented storage milestone and its remaining verification blockers; the README explicitly states it is a snapshot, not proof of implementation.",
