    {
      "id": "db28ce82-72c0-42ad-ac6f-eec1e7abd021",
      "text": "Subagents are allowed in Steps 1, 2, and 3 for result quality and dependency work; Step 3 must merge after review and push; and screenshots of changes and additions are required at every step. This replaces the earlier fixed two-agent limit and separate routine merge confirmation, while required verification and product/design acceptance remain in force. The current app's blocked checks are not claimed to have passed, and no app release is authorized. Source: docs/reference/source-register.md. | When: November 14, 2026 | Involving: Project owner; subagents and project agents | To support dependency work and improve implementation outcomes while preserving review and verification requirements.",
